---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Accessibility Statement | Fortitude Insurance";
const description = "Accessibility statement and commitment to digital inclusion at Fortitude Insurance.";

const lastUpdated = "February 1, 2026";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en">

  {/* SIMPLE HEADER */}
  <section class="pt-32 pb-12 bg-surface-light dark:bg-[#050505]">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-text-main dark:text-white mb-4">
        Accessibility Statement
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Our commitment to digital inclusion for all our clients.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* CONTENT */}
  <section class="pb-20 bg-surface-light dark:bg-[#050505]">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white dark:bg-[#151515] p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-white/5 shadow-xl">
        
        {/* Intro */}
        <div class="mb-10 pb-10 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-white/10">
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest">
                Last Updated: {lastUpdated}
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                At <strong>Fortitude Insurance Services LLC</strong>, we believe that insurance should be accessible to everyone. We strive to ensure that our website is user-friendly for people with disabilities, complying with industry standards.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-12 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">

            {/* 1. Standards and Commitment */}
            <article>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-text-main dark:text-white mb-4">
                    1. Standards & Commitment
                </h3>
                <p>
                    We have invested resources to help ensure that our website is easier to use and more accessible for people with disabilities, with the strong belief that every person has the right to live with dignity, equality, comfort, and independence.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4">
                    We continuously work to improve the user experience for everyone and apply the relevant accessibility standards, including the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA.
                </p>
            </article>

            {/* 2. Accessibility Measures */}
            <article>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-text-main dark:text-white mb-4">
                    2. Accessibility Features
                </h3>
                <p>
                    This website includes features designed to improve accessibility, such as:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-4 space-y-2 opacity-90">
                    <li><strong>Color Contrast:</strong> Optimized light and dark modes to reduce eye strain and improve text readability.</li>
                    <li><strong>Keyboard Navigation:</strong> Logical structure allowing menu and form navigation using only the keyboard.</li>
                    <li><strong>Alt Text:</strong> Descriptions on images for screen reader compatibility.</li>
                    <li><strong>Clear Forms:</strong> Explicit labels on all input fields to facilitate quote requests.</li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            {/* 3. Disclaimer */}
            <article>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-text-main dark:text-white mb-4">
                    3. Disclaimer
                </h3>
                <p>
                    Despite our efforts to make all pages and content fully accessible, some content may not have yet been fully adapted to the strictest accessibility standards. This may be a result of not having found or identified the most appropriate technological solution.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4">
                    Specifically, some third-party portals (such as carrier payment systems or external quoting tools) are outside our direct control, although we encourage our partners to maintain similar standards.
                </p>
            </article>

            {/* 4. Need Assistance? */}
            <article>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-text-main dark:text-white mb-4">
                    4. Need Assistance?
                </h3>
                <p>
                    If you are experiencing difficulty viewing or navigating the content on this website, or notice any content, feature, or functionality that you believe is not fully accessible to people with disabilities, please contact us.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-4">
                    We will be happy to assist you through an alternative communication method that is accessible to you (e.g., telephone support).
                </p>
            </article>

            {/* Contact */}
            <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-white/10">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-lg text-text-main dark:text-white mb-2">Accessibility Contact</h4>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">
                    We take your feedback seriously and will consider it as we evaluate ways to accommodate all of our customers.
                </p>
                <address class="not-italic text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
                    <strong>Fortitude Insurance Services LLC</strong><br/>
                    Phone: <a href="tel:813-753-4197" class="text-primary hover:underline">(813) 753-4197</a><br/>
                    Email: <a href="mailto:support@fortitudeins.us" class="text-primary hover:underline">support@fortitudeins.us</a>
                </address>
            </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>